WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.730
Just after dawn in a Thai town, a line
of monks walks slowly down the street,

2
00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:07.710
each carrying a bowl.

3
00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:11.710
They may not farm, cook
stored food, or handle money.

4
00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:15.010
People along the street
place rice in each bowl.

5
00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:18.330
The monks do not ask,
and do not say thank you.

6
00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:21.760
So who is really looking after whom?

7
00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:26.600
In this mission, you'll find out the
different things the word Sangha can mean.

8
00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:29.130
Then you'll follow the
life of a Thai temple,

9
00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:33.610
from the dawn alms round to the
robe-giving festival after the rains.

10
00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:37.330
Your mission: find out who
really looks after whom.
